al Rights states that every citizen shall have the right and the opportunity to take part in the conduct of public affairs and that this right is being undermined by the Queensland State Government; and (d) calls on the Beattie Government to make any amalgamations voluntary as recommended by the Federal Leader of the Opposition (Mr Rudd). Question put.","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-1379","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2007-08-13/1"}
